<td><h2>HITV - HitecVision completes fundraising</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2014-04-04 08:22:22</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>HitecVision completes fundraising for HitecVision VII and reached the hard cap of USD 1.9 billion, exceeding the USD 1.5 billion target. With strong support from existing investors and two new investors the hard cap was reached in two months following the launch in February 2014.</p></td>
